{"4469420":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Pixel Factory","steam_appid":4469420,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4469420\/extras\/b52f82f1d61aeb188dcbbc7a8e6f0e47.avif?t=1776180640\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4469420\/extras_big\/b52f82f1d61aeb188dcbbc7a8e6f0e47.avif?t=1776180640 width=1560 height=504 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel Factory is an automation and factory-building game where you design production lines to create colorful patterned blocks.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with simple clay cubes and turn them into complex products. Shape raw clay into cubes, paint them in different colors and combine them in various ways to create unique patterns. As production grows, you'll need to design efficient factory layouts and optimize every step of the process.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4469420\/extras\/48c36181e8067096f6f08d54e0ecd042.poster.avif?t=1776180640\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4469420\/extras\/48c36181e8067096f6f08d54e0ecd042.mp4?t=1776180640\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build machines, connect production lines and automate the entire workflow from raw materials to finished patterned products. Upgrade your buildings to increase efficiency, unlock new possibilities and scale your factory to handle larger and more complex designs.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Create clay cubes and transform them into colorful patterned blocks<br>• Paint cubes in different colors and combine them into unique designs<br>• Design and optimize automated production lines<br>• Upgrade buildings to improve speed and efficiency<br>• Build increasingly complex factory systems<br>• Expand and refine your industrial production network<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every block pattern is a puzzle. The challenge is not only producing items but designing the most efficient system possible.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4469420\/extras\/b52f82f1d61aeb188dcbbc7a8e6f0e47.avif?t=1776180640\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4469420\/extras_big\/b52f82f1d61aeb188dcbbc7a8e6f0e47.avif?t=1776180640 width=1560 height=504 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel Factory is an automation and factory-building game where you design production lines to create colorful patterned blocks.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with simple clay cubes and turn them into complex products. Shape raw clay into cubes, paint them in different colors and combine them in various ways to create unique patterns. As production grows, you'll need to design efficient factory layouts and optimize every step of the process.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4469420\/extras\/48c36181e8067096f6f08d54e0ecd042.poster.avif?t=1776180640\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4469420\/extras\/48c36181e8067096f6f08d54e0ecd042.mp4?t=1776180640\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build machines, connect production lines and automate the entire workflow from raw materials to finished patterned products. Upgrade your buildings to increase efficiency, unlock new possibilities and scale your factory to handle larger and more complex designs.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Create clay cubes and transform them into colorful patterned blocks<br>• Paint cubes in different colors and combine them into unique designs<br>• Design and optimize automated production lines<br>• Upgrade buildings to improve speed and efficiency<br>• Build increasingly complex factory systems<br>• Expand and refine your industrial production network<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every block pattern is a puzzle. The challenge is not only producing items but designing the most efficient system possible.<\/p>","short_description":"Build and automate your own factory in Pixel Factory. Paint cubes in different colors and create unique patterns, design efficient production lines and upgrade your buildings to optimize production.","supported_languages":"영어, 튀르키예어, 프랑스어, 독일어, 스페인어 - 스페인, 중국어 간체, 포르투갈어 - 브라질, 중국어 번체, 일본어, 한국어, 스페인어 - 중남미, 폴란드어, 포르투갈어 - 포르투갈, 러시아어","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4469420\/46a16bc917b8b38a458517b73dcfb89df0abf508\/header.jpg?t=1776180640","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4469420\/a90fd5837dfba77ccdac978ce455b3cd5812b526\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776180640","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4469420\/a90fd5837dfba77ccdac978ce455b3cd5812b526\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1776180640","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>최소:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>운영 체제 *:<\/strong> Windows 7<br><\/li><li><strong>프로세서:<\/strong> 6th Generation Intel® Core™ i5 Processors<br><\/li><li><strong>메모리:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>그래픽:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce 930<br><\/li><li><strong>저장 공간:<\/s